Team leadership & Resource allocation: supervising a team of software engineers, providing
guidance, and ensuring effective collaboration, assigning tasks and resources to team
members based on their skills and project needs
Project management: planning, prioritizing, and coordinating software development projects
Performance management: evaluate team members' performance, providing feedback, and
supporting their professional growth
Stakeholder communication: work with other departments, management, and clients to align
on goals and expectations.
Hiring and team building: recruiting new talent and fostering a positive team culture.